{"id":"en_my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend","title":"My Hot Firefighter Ex-Boyfriend","titleEn":"My Hot Firefighter Ex-Boyfriend","description":"A woman dials 911 after accidentally handcuffing herself to her bed, expecting a locksmith to come to her rescue. What arrives instead is her ex-boyfriend, who kicks down her door with three other firefighters at his back. Seeing her restrained, he jumps to the conclusion that another man tied her up and then walked out on her. In her flustered panic, she lets slip the words \"No, I didn't use protection,\" which only deepens his suspicion. He is left angry and jealous, and he refuses to accept the truth she tries to explain. A mortifying mishap has turned into a major misunderstanding between the two of them, and neither is prepared for where it leads.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Second Chance","Small Town","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df2go/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df2go/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df2go/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-hot-firefighter-ex-boyfriend_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7df2go/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"e